{"unit_id":"tag:03YF:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在关于代数空间（algebraic spaces）上拓扑（topologies）的章节中（见《代数空间上的拓扑（Topologies）》第 <REF_0001> 节），我们介绍了代数空间（algebraic spaces）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）、fppf、光滑（smooth）、句法（syntomic）及 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc coverings）。本章讨论代数空间（algebraic spaces）上的哪些结构能够沿这类覆盖（coverings）下降（descended）。例如参见 <REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>、<REF_0005>、<REF_0006> 和 <REF_0007>。\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"descended","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本章对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"前章主题；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"句法","context":"覆盖类型；中文暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fpqc coverings","target_term":"fpqc 覆盖","context":"覆盖类型；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"下降的覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"descended","target_term":"下降","context":"本章讨论的操作；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
