{"unit_id":"tag:041I:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们始终假设所有概形（schemes）都包含在一个大（big）fppf 位点（site）<MATH_0001> 中，所考虑的所有环（rings）<MATH_0002> 都满足：<MATH_0003> 同构（isomorphic）于这个大（big）位点（site）的某个对象（object）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n设 <MATH_0004> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0005> 是代数空间（algebraic space），其基底为 <MATH_0006>。本章及后续章节中，我们用 <MATH_0007> 表示 <MATH_0008> 与自身的积（product）（在 <MATH_0009> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的范畴（category）中），而不用 <MATH_0010>。\n\n\n\n\n\n","allowed_english":["fppf"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"固定约定；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"big","target_term":"大","context":"大fppf位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"固定位点；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"所考虑的环；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"环对应的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"位点的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"给定对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"product","target_term":"积","context":"记号约定；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"积所在范畴；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"积所在范畴；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
