{"unit_id":"tag:04W2:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节是《下降（Descent）》第 <REF_0001> 节在代数空间（algebraic spaces）情形下的对应版本。先阅读该节是有益的。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"本节对象；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04W3:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme）。设 <MATH_0002> 是态射族（family of morphisms），其对象是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic spaces），并有固定目标 <MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 关于给定族的<TEXTITOPEN_0001>下降资料（descent datum）<MATH_0005>，用于拟凝聚层（for quasi-coherent sheaves）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，由下列数据给出：拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0006>，定义于 <MATH_0007> 上，对每个 <MATH_0008> 各给定一个；以及拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0009>-模（modules）的同构（isomorphism）<MATH_0010>，对每一对 <MATH_0011> 各给定一个，使得每组三重指标 <MATH_0012> 对应的图（diagram）<MATH_0013>（其对象为 <MATH_0014>-模（modules））交换（commutes）。这称为<TEXTITOPEN_0002>余循环条件（cocycle condition）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 一个<TEXTITOPEN_0003>态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>，在下降资料之间（of descent data）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，由族（family）<MATH_0016> 给出，其成员是 <MATH_0017>-模（modules）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0018>，使得所有图（diagrams）<MATH_0019> 都交换（commute）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"descent datum","target_term":"下降资料"},{"source_term":"for quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"用于拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"余循环条件"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"of descent data","target_term":"下降资料之间"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"给定族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"族的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"descent datum","target_term":"下降资料","context":"定义中的资料；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"for quasi-coherent sheaves","target_term":"用于拟凝聚层","context":"资料所属的结构；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent sheaf","target_term":"拟凝聚层","context":"给定的层；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"quasi-coherent","target_term":"拟凝聚","context":"同构的模；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"图及态射的对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"给定的粘合映射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图","context":"三重指标的图；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"交换","context":"三重指标的图；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"余循环条件","context":"命名的条件；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下降资料之间的映射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"of descent data","target_term":"下降资料之间","context":"映射所属结构；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"给定映射族；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"模之间的映射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"diagrams","target_term":"图","context":"映射相容图；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"交换","context":"映射相容条件；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
